<Base
  title="Work with me"
  description="Freelance engineering and early-stage product discovery via Alpacus: AI in healthcare, machine learning systems, and figuring out what to build."
>
  <h1>Work with me</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    Through my company <a href="https://alpacus.nl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Alpacus</a> I
    take on a small number of engagements next to my role at kaiko.ai. Two kinds of work fit
    well:
  </p>

  <section>
    <h2>Early-stage product & discovery consulting</h2>
    <p>
      You have an idea, often involving AI, often in healthcare, and the expensive question is
      not <em>how</em> to build it but <em>whether and what</em> to build. I help teams sharpen
      the problem, find the riskiest assumptions, and design the cheapest way to test them
      before committing an engineering budget. Ten years of taking deep learning from
      architecture design to clinical deployment means I've seen where these projects die, and
      it's rarely in the model.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Freelance engineering</h2>
    <p>
      Hands-on machine learning and software engineering: training and evaluating deep learning
      models, computational pathology pipelines, whole-slide imaging tooling, and pragmatic
      infrastructure to run it all. I build things that survive contact with production.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Sounds useful?</h2>
    <p>
      Reach out via <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/daan-geijs-188009121/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
      or through <a href="https://alpacus.nl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">alpacus.nl</a>. A
      short description of your problem is the best opener.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>

